SUMMARY:Vistor's Center to Highway 25 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club 2.0\nWe will meet
  at nine. in the parking lot of the visitor's center and gather near the r
 ock kiosk at the trailhead\, aiming to leave no later than 9:10 a.m. This 
 is a five mile round trip hike at about 2.9 mph. to 3.4 mph. So\, it's a p
 retty good clip. We stop 1/2 through for a water break and then return.\n\
 nPlease note: The meeting point is the BRP Visitor's Center\, NOT the Folk
  Art Center.
